{# The GATE — the product's SECOND chrome, and the peer of `shell` rather than a
   variant of it (BB-415 D6). It frames everything that stands BEFORE the
   product: a surface that is, by definition, outside every workspace.

   WHY IT IS NOT `shell`. The rail is workspace-ambient, and
   its workspace links (`WorkspaceMenuLink`) are denied on a route that
   carries no workspace — so `shell` here would render a navigation with no
   reachable entry, which reads as a defect rather than as a state. It shares no
   slot with `shell` either: that one is a full-viewport flex layout with
   sidebar/header/content/footer/overlay, this one is a top bar over a card.

   ONE QUIET LINK OUT, AND NO NAVIGATION. The top bar carries the product mark
   and a single Docs link; a gate offers the one thing the page is for and
   nothing else, because a link into a workspace the reader may not be in is
   exactly the wrong guess `BbWorkspaceAccessCheck` answers with a 404.

   The `mark` slot is the product mark, and it is a SLOT rather than a prop
   because a mark is rendered content — an icon component, an image — and props
   carry scalar data only. `content` is the one region a screen fills, exactly
   as in `shell`. `aside` is the brand column the login page fills; with it the
   body becomes two columns from `lg`, brand first, and without it the card
   stays centred alone.

   NOT A SCROLL CONTAINER. `min-h-screen` lets a long card grow the page rather
   than clip itself, which keeps a chooser with twenty workspaces readable. #}
<div{{ (attributes ?: create_attribute()).addClass(['gate', 'min-h-screen', 'flex', 'flex-col', 'bg-app', 'text-text']) }}>
  <header class="flex items-center justify-between gap-group p-gutter">
    <div class="min-w-0">{% block mark %}{% if mark %}{{ mark }}{% endif %}{% endblock %}</div>
    {# SDC does not apply schema defaults at render time; every gate page links the docs. #}
    {% set docs_url = docs_url|default('https://bakers.build') %}
    {% if docs_url %}
      <a href="{{ docs_url }}" class="text-meta text-text-light hover:text-text hover:underline underline-offset-4">{{ 'Docs'|t }}</a>
    {% endif %}
  </header>
  <main class="flex-1 flex items-center justify-center p-gutter">
    <div class="w-full {{ aside ? 'max-w-5xl grid gap-section items-center lg:grid-cols-2' : 'flex justify-center' }}">
      {% if aside %}
        <div class="gate__aside min-w-0">{% block aside %}{{ aside }}{% endblock %}</div>
      {% endif %}
      <div class="gate__card w-full max-w-[420px] {{ aside ? 'justify-self-center lg:justify-self-end' }} flex flex-col gap-group p-gutter bg-surface border border-border-2 rounded-[var(--radius-md,10px)]">
        {% if title %}
          <h1 class="gate__title text-section-title text-center">{{ title }}</h1>
        {% endif %}
        {% if description %}
          <p class="gate__description text-meta text-text-faint text-center max-w-[40ch] mx-auto">{{ description }}</p>
        {% endif %}
        <div class="gate__content min-w-0">{% block content %}{% if content %}{{ content }}{% endif %}{% endblock %}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</div>
